---
// Apply CTA — conversion section
---

<section class="py-28 sm:py-36 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-gold text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] mb-6">
      The Door Is Open
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-black tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
      Step Up.<br />
      <span class="text-white/50">Get Represented.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-white/50 font-medium max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      MMA. Kun Khmer. Grappling. If you're built for it, we'll get you on the card.
      Five minutes, three disciplines, one shot at the world stage.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/apply"
        class="bg-brand-gold text-white px-10 py-4 font-bold rounded-lg text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-colors shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(207,102,73,0.25)] active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        Apply Now
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/partner"
        class="px-10 py-4 font-bold rounded-lg text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] border border-white/10 text-white/50 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-colors active:scale-95"
      >
        Partner with Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
